      "v0.1.94 fixes pinch zoom on Gold by installing the gesture owner on live Game2 and routing diorama pinch to world:zoomStep",
      "v0.1.93 activates two-finger pinch zoom for the Gold voxel world: smooth third-person boom scaling plus diorama/survey zoom",
      "v0.1.92 makes LIVE OVERWORLD BATTLES seamless by skipping Gold's black-circle encounter transition for ordinary wild encounters",
      "v0.1.91 adds CAMERA CONTROL AUTO/THIS MOD/CHARACTER SELECTOR; AUTO follows red_3d_player's public voxel ZOOM/1ST/3RD camera state",
      "independent 2D visible-Wilds compose fallback when voxel is pending or failed",
      "compose-time Wilds map initialization self-heal with rate limiting",
      "Pokemon Stadium 2 model archive reader at 0x027ED000",
      "Pokemon Stadium 2 skeletal-animation archive reader at 0x02D7D000",
      "Stadium 2 ROM picker for user-supplied z64/n64/v64 files",
