    fixed = {
      "v0.2.81 makes trainer FOLLOW mode slot-bound so PARTY -> SWITCH immediately changes the follower to the new party leader, including same-species/shiny swaps",
      "v0.2.80 restores full-color Gold 2D Pokemon followers by removing the stale Gen-1 luminance conversion from normal/shiny land, submerged-water and party-icon paths",
      "v0.2.79 upgrades local Stadium packs to DSM7, restoring SetTileSize SL/TL origin and SH/TH clamp windows plus zero-mask clamp semantics to fix one-sided mirrored face/eye sampling",
      "v0.2.78 upgrades local Stadium packs to DSM6, restoring per-material N64 palette/wrap/mirror/clamp/UV-shift/lighting state and generalized untextured primitives for the reported texture-broken Pokémon",
      "v0.2.78 keeps the custom Pokédex backing list in strict National Dex #001-#251 order so cursor, selected model and displayed number stay synchronized",
