      "v0.2.35 replaces live-battle PACK and PKMN full-screen Gold menus with Stadium-style four-row selectors while keeping Gold switch/item logic underneath",
      "v0.2.34 routes all four battle face-button commands through Gold native BattleState A-confirm dispatcher and fully yields HUD ownership during pushed PACK/PKMN submenus",
      "v0.2.33 fixes Triangle/Y PKMN doing nothing in live 3D battles by resolving face-button input against the actual OverworldBattle BattleState, while yielding immediately to Gold once the native party/item submenu is pushed",
      "v0.2.32 fixes the 0.2.28 scenery dissolve being installed only on legacy BattleScene instead of the live Gold VoxelScene, and hardens mapped/raw left-stick ownership so it cannot navigate the battle menu",
