      "v0.2.10 fixes the v0.2.06 capture wrapper being bypassable and fixes the documented left/right mouse capture controls that were not actually polled",
      "v0.2.09 fixes Lugia-style detached Stadium 2 model parts by validating full X/Y/Z posed bounds and major-bone travel at runtime, protects already-built DSM4 caches, and keeps rejected clips on the intact 3D bind pose with sprite fallback for an invalid bind",
      "v0.2.08 removes the remaining native 2D player-Pokémon send-out flash when that side already has a loaded Stadium model, while retaining the normal sprite fallback when no model exists",
