      "v0.2.06 preserves the normal wild-battle path as a fail-safe when capture prerequisites are unavailable and keeps mouse/right-stick camera control active inside the transparent capture state",
      "v0.2.05 makes F6 survive swallowed/replaced Game2 key callbacks by adding an edge-triggered keyboard-state poll, and makes mapped right-stick look survive missing gamepadaxis callbacks by polling rightx/righty every frame",
      "v0.2.04 stops connected Gold routes from being treated as voxel-world edges, masks synthetic forest under real neighbours, reuses prebuilt neighbour meshes on seam entry, and gives camera/follower seam code actual neighbour Map objects",
